    "If a patch is incompatible and makes the game crash, it is turned off automatically the next time you launch, so you can keep playing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If a patch is incompatible and makes the game crash, it is turned off automatically the next time you launch, so you can keep playing."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si un parche es incompatible y hace que el juego se cierre, se desactiva automáticamente la próxima vez que inicies, para que puedas seguir jugando."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Si un correctif est incompatible et fait planter le jeu, il est désactivé automatiquement au prochain lancement pour que vous puissiez continuer à jouer."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パッチに互換性がなくゲームがクラッシュした場合、次回起動時に自動的にオフになるため、引き続きプレイできます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "开着补丁如遇到不兼容导致游戏崩溃，下次启动会自动将崩溃补丁关掉以确保您正常游戏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "開著補丁如遇到不相容導致遊戲崩潰，下次啟動會自動將崩潰補丁關掉以確保您正常遊戲。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
