    "Signing doesn’t match the bundle ID": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Signing doesn’t match the bundle ID"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La firma no coincide con el bundle ID"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La Signature ne correspond pas à l'identifiant de bundle"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "署名がバンドル ID と一致しません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "签名和包名不一致"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "簽名和包名不一致"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This copy of S2Arm was signed with the App ID “%@”, but its bundle ID is “%@”. iOS may refuse to hand the folder you pick to S2Arm, so tapping Open may do nothing. If that happens, change the bundle ID to “%@” in your signing tool and sign again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This copy of S2Arm was signed with the App ID “%@”, but its bundle ID is “%@”. iOS may refuse to hand the folder you pick to S2Arm, so tapping Open may do nothing. If that happens, change the bundle ID to “%@” in your signing tool and sign again."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta copia de S2Arm se firmó con el App ID «%@», pero su bundle ID es «%@». iOS puede negarse a entregar la carpeta que elijas a S2Arm, por lo que tocar Abrir puede no hacer nada. Si eso ocurre, cambia el bundle ID a «%@» en tu herramienta de firma y vuelve a firmar."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cette copie de S2Arm a été signée avec l'App ID « %@ », mais son identifiant de bundle est « %@ ». iOS peut refuser de transmettre le dossier sélectionné à S2Arm, auquel cas appuyer sur Ouvrir ne fera rien. Si cela se produit, changez l'identifiant de bundle en « %@ » dans votre outil de Signature, puis resignez."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "この S2Arm は App ID「%@」で署名されていますが、バンドル ID は「%@」です。iOS が選択したフォルダを S2Arm に渡すことを拒否する可能性があり、「開く」をタップしても反応しない場合があります。その場合は、署名ツールでバンドル ID を「%@」に変更して再署名してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这份 S2Arm 签名用的 App ID 是「%@」，包名却是「%@」。系统可能不肯把你选的文件夹交给 S2Arm，点「打开」会没反应。遇到这种情况，请在签名工具里把包名改成「%@」再签一次。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這份 S2Arm 簽名用的 App ID 是「%@」，包名卻是「%@」。系統可能不肯把你選的資料夾交給 S2Arm，點「開啟」會沒反應。遇到這種情況，請在簽名工具裡把包名改成「%@」再籤一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Continue to Choose": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Continue to Choose"
          }
        },
        "es": {
